\
All output files are written to a **`Coregistration/`** subfolder inside your data folder:\
\
| File | Description |\
|---|---|\
| `registered_mask.tif` | The moving mask after alignment |\
| `mask_moving_*_coregistered_binarized.png` | Binary (black/white) version |\
| `*_coregistered.tif / .png` | Each channel image after alignment |\
| `Coregistration_composite.h5` | The mathematical transform (for reuse) |\
| `Coregistration_displacement.mha` | Displacement field (for quality control) |\
| `*_gradient.tif` | Gradient maps used internally by the algorithm |\
