## Output quality interpretation\
\
| Dice score | IoU equivalent | Interpretation |\
|---|---|---|\
| > 0.90 | > 0.82 | Excellent alignment |\
| 0.80 \'96 0.90 | 0.67 \'96 0.82 | Good \'97 suitable for most downstream analyses |\
| 0.65 \'96 0.80 | 0.48 \'96 0.67 | Acceptable \'97 check the visual overlay |\
| < 0.65 | < 0.48 | Poor \'97 review input masks and try different settings |\
\
> **What is compared:** the fixed segmentation mask (`ICP_mask.png`) vs the registered\
> moving mask (`registered_mask.tif`), both binarised (any cell label > 0 counts as\
> foreground). See *Step 5* above for the full formula.\
\
