\
## Troubleshooting checklist\
\
- [ ] Are both mask files in the same folder you selected?\
- [ ] Are the pixel sizes (`fixed_pixel_size`, `moving_pixel_size`) set correctly?\
- [ ] Do the masks contain foreground pixels (are they not all black)?\
- [ ] Is SciPy installed? (`pip install scipy`) \'97 required for FFT pre-alignment\
- [ ] For TIFF masks: does the file open correctly in ImageJ/Fiji?\
\
